{
  "description": "通过任务开始时冻结的 GPT OAuth 或已显式启用的 OpenAI Images API 连接生成图片。target 绑定当前获授权的课件或对象，省略时生成独立工作空间资源。ready 返回本任务资源，可用 project.apply from 插入或 media.apply 原位替换，也可直接把 htmlSource 用作 HTML 图片 src 或 CSS 图片 URL；软件读取已授权字节并存入工程，勿自造资源地址。ready 本身未写入工程。当前请求 PNG、auto/low/medium/high 画质。",
  "inputSchema": {
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "output": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "background": {
            "enum": [
              "auto",
              "opaque",
              "transparent"
            ],
            "type": "string"
          },
          "format": {
            "const": "png",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "quality": {
            "enum": [
              "auto",
              "low",
              "medium",
              "high"
            ],
            "type": "string"
          },
          "size": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "const": "auto",
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "pattern": "^\\d{2,5}x\\d{2,5}$",
                "type": "string"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "object"
      },
      "prompt": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      },
      "target": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "prompt"
    ],
    "type": "object"
  },
  "invocation": "静态目录只说明已登记接口；当前运行是否可调用、文档范围、写权限、短句柄和服务配置，以宿主本轮发现与实际回执为准。",
  "manual": {
    "group": "edit",
    "label": "image.generate",
    "targetKinds": [
      "document",
      "course-surface",
      "course-instance"
    ]
  },
  "name": "image.generate",
  "version": 1
}
